OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEvening
OL,6,Fshowers becoming confined to coastal
OL,7,Fareas overnight. Largely cloudy, but
OL,8,Fsome clear spells are likely, allowing
OL,9,Fa few frost patches and some areas of
OL,10,Ffog to develop.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FAny fog will be slow to clear
OL,13,Fon Monday morning, but bright or sunny
OL,14,Fspells gradually developing. Coastal
OL,15,Fshowers mostly dying out in the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Cool.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
