OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry Tuesday with sunny spells after
OL,7,Fany early fog clears. Perhaps some
OL,8,Frain overnight in the south. Mostly
OL,9,Fdry Wednesday and Thursday with
OL,10,Fisolated showers. Temperatures turning
OL,11,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
